# Exactly eight public Markdown guides. Internal notes remain local even when
# colocated with source code; required contracts remain in code/configuration.
*.md
!/README.md
!/ENV_SETUP.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/tests/README.md

# Necessary public guides only. Dated audits, queue diaries and freeze reports
# stay local; their paths may still be needed by historical experiment scripts.
/docs/**
!/docs/API.md
!/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!/docs/REPRODUCTION.md
!/docs/BASELINES.md

# Exact image allowlist: rasterized from the six active paper figure PDFs.
# No general *.png exception: a new image requires an explicit review.
!/docs/assets/
